---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services — Compliance, Web, IT, AI & Phone Systems | CC3PO" description="CC3PO services — compliance monitoring, website design, IT support, AI automation, and phone systems for small businesses. When services connect, they multiply.">

  <section class="hero" id="main-content">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Compliance Leads.<br>Full Stack Delivers.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">ADA compliance gets you in the door. Web development, IT support, AI automation, and phone systems keep you growing. Every service compounds — one improvement lifts everything.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="linc-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="linc-badge">Full Stack</div>
      <h2 class="linc-headline">Five Services. One System.</h2>
      <p class="linc-desc">Compliance is the spear. Tech stack is the shaft. Most agencies sell you one thing — we build systems where every piece makes the next piece stronger. <strong>Compliance monitoring</strong> identifies what's broken. <strong>Web development</strong> builds what you need. <strong>IT support</strong> keeps it running. <strong>AI automation</strong> makes it smart. <strong>Phone systems</strong> connect you to customers. That's CC3PO.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stacks-section">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- COMPLIANCE + AUTOMATION STACK -->
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="stack-header">
          <span class="stack-icon">🛡️</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="stack-title">Compliance + Tech Stack</h3>
            <p class="stack-tagline">WCAG auditing + automated monitoring + IT support = continuous compliance, not one-and-done</p>
          </div>
          <span class="stack-linc-score">LINC Score: 9.2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-compound">
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Compliance identifies the gaps</strong>
              <span>ADA, WCAG & HIPAA audits reveal what's broken</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Web dev & IT fix them</strong>
              <span>Website fixes, IT support, and monitoring keeps them from coming back</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot compound-dot--end"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Result: Compliance that compounds</strong>
              <span>Every audit makes the tech stack smarter. Every fix prevents the next finding.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-services">
          <a href="/products/shield/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h4>Compliance Monitoring</h4>
            <p>ADA, WCAG & HIPAA scanning. Continuous protection from $4K+ lawsuits.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $97/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/services/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🌐</div>
            <h4>Website Design</h4>
            <p>Modern, fast, mobile-first websites. ADA-compliant. Built for conversion.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $2,500</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/services/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🔧</div>
            <h4>IT Support</h4>
            <p>Proactive IT, security patching, backups, and monitoring. Your tech stack, handled.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $197/mo</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- LOCAL BUSINESS + AI STACK -->
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="stack-header">
          <span class="stack-icon">📞</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="stack-title">Local Business + AI Stack</h3>
            <p class="stack-tagline">Website + AI phone answering + automation = no lead left behind</p>
          </div>
          <span class="stack-linc-score">LINC Score: 9.4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-compound">
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Website captures every lead</strong>
              <span>Modern, fast, conversion-optimized design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>AI answers calls 24/7</strong>
              <span>Callie — our AI receptionist — answers, qualifies, and transfers live</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot compound-dot--end"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Result: Revenue that compounds</strong>
              <span>More captured leads → more data → smarter AI → more conversions. Every call answered.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-services">
          <a href="/services/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🌐</div>
            <h4>Website Design</h4>
            <p>Modern, fast, mobile-first websites built for conversion. ADA-compliant.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $2,500</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/ai-voice-agent/" class="stack-service-card featured">
            <div class="ss-icon">📞</div>
            <h4>AI Phone Answering (Callie)</h4>
            <p>Never miss a call again. Callie answers, qualifies, and transfers — 24/7.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $497/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/ai-workflow-audit/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🤖</div>
            <h4>AI Workflow Audit</h4>
            <p>Find where AI can save you 10+ hours/week. Automate the boring stuff.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $497/mo</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CONTENT + RESEARCH STACK -->
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="stack-header">
          <span class="stack-icon">📝</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="stack-title">Content + Research Stack</h3>
            <p class="stack-tagline">Blog + social + research = compounding authority</p>
          </div>
          <span class="stack-linc-score">LINC Score: 8.7</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-compound">
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Research feeds content</strong>
              <span>AI-driven insights become blog posts, social posts, newsletters</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Content builds authority</strong>
              <span>Published consistently, optimizing for search and engagement</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot compound-dot--end"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Result: Authority that compounds</strong>
              <span>Every post strengthens SEO. Every insight makes the next post better. Content becomes an asset, not an expense.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-services">
          <a href="/services/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">📝</div>
            <h4>Daily Content</h4>
            <p>AI-written blog posts, social media, and newsletters published on autopilot. Your brand, your voice, every day.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $297/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/pricing/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">💰</div>
            <h4>Care Plans</h4>
            <p>IT support that grows with you. Proactive monitoring, priority response, and monthly health checks.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $97/mo</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- NEW: AUTOMATED SERVICES STACK -->
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="stack-header">
          <span class="stack-icon">🤖</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="stack-title">Automated Services Stack</h3>
            <p class="stack-tagline">AI-powered monitoring, backup, security, and optimization — all automated</p>
          </div>
          <span class="stack-linc-score">LINC Score: 8.5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-compound">
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>AI monitors everything</strong>
              <span>Chatbot compliance, AI visibility, SSL certs, uptime — all checked daily</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Automated fixes & backups</strong>
              <span>Auto-fix disclosures, auto-renew SSL, daily M365/Workspace backups</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="compound-connector"></div>
          <div class="compound-step">
            <div class="compound-dot compound-dot--end"></div>
            <div class="compound-content">
              <strong>Result: Zero-touch operations</strong>
              <span>Daily Telegram one-liners, monthly PDFs, 30-day TTL auto-cancel. Set it and forget it.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-services">
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/disclose-shield/" class="stack-service-card featured">
            <div class="ss-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h4>DiscloseShield</h4>
            <p>Automated AI chatbot disclosure monitoring for EU AI Act compliance. Daily scans, alerts, and auto-fixes.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $67/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/visible-ai/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">👁️</div>
            <h4>VisibleAI</h4>
            <p>Monitor what AI search engines say about your business. Perplexity, ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $79/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/backup-shield/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">💾</div>
            <h4>BackupShield</h4>
            <p>Automated backup for Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace. Daily backups, restore drills.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $97/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/secure-stack/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🔒</div>
            <h4>SecureStack</h4>
            <p>EDR, DNS filtering, and password manager for SMBs. Cyber insurance compliant.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $37/user/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/resena/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">⭐</div>
            <h4>Reseña</h4>
            <p>Bilingual Google Business Profile review management. AI replies in English or Spanish.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $97/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/pixel-diet/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🖼️</div>
            <h4>PixelDiet</h4>
            <p>Automated image optimization and CDN delivery. WebP/AVIF conversion.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $39/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/cert-guard/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">🔐</div>
            <h4>CertGuard</h4>
            <p>SSL certificate monitoring and auto-renewal. Never let a cert expire.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $19/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/site-health/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">📊</div>
            <h4>SiteHealth</h4>
            <p>Uptime, Core Web Vitals, and error monitoring with public status pages.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $49/mo</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/inbox-concierge/" class="stack-service-card">
            <div class="ss-icon">📬</div>
            <h4>InboxConcierge</h4>
            <p>Bilingual AI inbox triage. AI sorts emails, drafts replies, sends daily digest.</p>
            <span class="ss-price">From $97/mo</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="uncarved-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="uncarved-card">
        <span class="uncarved-icon">◻️</span>
        <h2>We're Not a Specialist Tool.<br>We're the Uncarved Block.</h2>
        <p>Most agencies do one thing well. We do many things that <em>connect</em> well. The uncarved block — 多 朴 — represents unlimited potential before it's shaped into something limited. We stay multi-domain, adaptive, compounding. That's why stacks outperform standalone services.</p>
        <div class="uncarved-principles">
          <div class="uncarved-principle">
            <strong>Multi-domain</strong>
            <span>Compliance, IT, content, AI — not siloed, connected</span>
          </div>
          <div class="uncarved-principle">
            <strong>Adaptive</strong>
            <span>Stacks flex as your business evolves</span>
          </div>
          <div class="uncarved-principle">
            <strong>Compounding</strong>
            <span>Every improvement lifts the whole system</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Find Out Which Stack Fits Your Business</h2>
      <p>Our Intelligence Architecture Audit maps your current systems and shows you exactly which stack will compound fastest for your business.</p>
      <a href="https://insights.cc3po.com/products/" class="btn btn-primary">Browse All Products →</a>
      <a href="/intelligence-audit" class="btn btn-secondary">Get Your Intelligence Audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050508 0%, #1a0a2e 50%, #050508 100%);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 120px 24px 80px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #a78bfa, #4fc3f7);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* LINC Intro Section */
  .linc-intro {
    padding: 80px 0 40px;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .linc-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,0.25);
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: rgba(233,69,96,0.06);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .linc-headline {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }
  .linc-desc {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .linc-desc strong {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .linc-desc em {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* Stacks Section */
  .stacks-section {
    padding: 60px 0 80px;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
  }
  .stack {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 36px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .stack:hover {
    border-color: rgba(233,69,96,0.2);
  }
  .stack-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .stack-icon {
    font-size: 36px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .stack-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .stack-tagline {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .stack-linc-score {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--success);
    background: rgba(0,230,118,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,0.15);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Compound Flow */
  .stack-compound {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .compound-step {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 8px;
  }
  .compound-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(233,69,96,0.4);
  }
  .compound-dot--end {
    background: var(--success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,230,118,0.4);
  }
  .compound-content strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .compound-content span {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
    display: block;
  }
  .compound-connector {
    width: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .compound-connector::after {
    content: '';
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--success));
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* Stack Service Cards */
  .stack-services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .stack-service-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .stack-service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(233,69,96,0.15);
  }
  .stack-service-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), rgba(79,195,247,0.05));
  }
  .stack-service-card.featured:hover {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(79,195,247,0.15);
  }
  .ss-icon {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .stack-service-card h4 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .stack-service-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .ss-price {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .stack-service-card.featured .ss-price {
    color: var(--success);
  }

  /* Uncarved Block Section */
  .uncarved-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }
  .uncarved-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 48px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .uncarved-icon {
    font-size: 40px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .uncarved-card h2 {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .uncarved-card p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }
  .uncarved-card em {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .uncarved-principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .uncarved-principle {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 16px;
  }
  .uncarved-principle strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .uncarved-principle span {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d0d0f, #1a0a2e);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-section h2 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }
  .cta-section p {
    color: #a1a1aa;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e94560, #4fc3f7);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 8px;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(233,69,96,0.35);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: #4fc3f7;
    border: 2px solid #4fc3f7;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 8px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(79,195,247,0.1);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 100px 20px 60px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .stack-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
